# GitNexus index scope for AuraGo.
# Keep application source, UI, prompts, documentation, scripts, tool manifests,
# and deployment templates indexable. Exclude local state, secrets, generated
# artifacts, dependency caches, binaries, reports, and agent scratch data.
# GitNexus also reads .gitignore; keep runtime exclusions explicit here so
# GITNEXUS_NO_GITIGNORE cannot accidentally index local data or packaged copies.

